<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:x="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:excel" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40"><head><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><x:ExcelWorkbook><x:ExcelWorksheets><x:ExcelWorksheet><x:Name>Worksheet</x:Name><x:WorksheetOptions><x:DisplayGridlines/></x:WorksheetOptions></x:ExcelWorksheet></x:ExcelWorksheets></x:ExcelWorkbook></xml><![endif]--></head><body><table>   <thead> <tr> <th aria-label="秩" data-stat="rank" scope="col" class=" poptip sort_default_asc center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Rank&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Squad finish in competition&lt;br&gt;Finish within the league or competition.&lt;br&gt;For knockout competitions may show final round reached.&lt;br&gt;Colors and arrows represent promotion/relegation or qualifiation for continental cups.&lt;br&gt;Trophy indicates team won league whether by playoffs or by leading the table.&lt;br&gt;Star indicates topped table in league USING another means of naming champion.">路克</th> <th aria-label="队" data-stat="team" scope="col" class=" poptip sort_default_asc center">队</th> <th aria-label="比赛场次" data-stat="games" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Matches Played&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Matches Played by the player or squad">议员</th> <th aria-label="胜利" data-stat="wins" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Wins&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Wins">W</th> <th aria-label="平局" data-stat="ties" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Draws&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Draws">D</th> <th aria-label="损失" data-stat="losses" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Losses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Losses">L</th> <th aria-label="目标" data-stat="goals_for" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Goals For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Goals For">GF</th> <th aria-label="失球" data-stat="goals_against" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Goals Against&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Goals Against">GA</th> <th aria-label="进球差" data-stat="goal_diff" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Goal Difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Goal Difference">GD</th> <th aria-label="积分" data-stat="points" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Most leagues are ordered by points.&lt;br&gt;Three for a win and one for a draw.">积分</th> <th aria-label="每场比赛得分" data-stat="points_avg" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Points/Match&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Points per Match Played">点数/MP</th> <th aria-label="每场比赛的出席人数" data-stat="attendance_per_g" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Attendance/Game&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Attendance per game during this season, only for home matches">出勤率</th> <th aria-label="最佳球队得分手" data-stat="top_team_scorers" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="Only includes league matches for that season">最佳球队得分手</th> <th aria-label="守门员" data-stat="top_keeper" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="Goalkeeper with the most minutes in league play">守门员</th> <th aria-label="笔记" data-stat="notes" scope="col" class=" poptip center">笔记</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr data-row="0"><th scope="row" class="right " data-stat="rank" csk="1">1</th><td class="left " data-stat="team"> 全北</td><td class="right " data-stat="games">38</td><td class="right " data-stat="wins">22</td><td class="right " data-stat="ties">10</td><td class="right " data-stat="losses">6</td><td class="right " data-stat="goals_for">71</td><td class="right " data-stat="goals_against">37</td><td class="right " data-stat="goal_diff">+34</td><td class="right " data-stat="points">76</td><td class="right " data-stat="points_avg">2.00</td><td class="right " data-stat="attendance_per_g" csk="4341">4,341</td><td class="right " data-stat="top_team_scorers" csk="15">古斯塔沃，斯坦尼斯拉夫·伊尔尤琴科- 15</td><td class="right " data-stat="top_keeper">宋范根</td><td class="left iz" data-stat="notes"></td>